ll)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#616161'&gt;In:&lt;/font&gt; message, conversation, act scope &amp; outline&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#616161'&gt;Out:&lt;/font&gt; language, intent, in scope?, English search queries" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=3;arcSize=5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="465" y="115" width="190" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="&lt;b&gt;2 · Route · library.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#616161'&gt;In:&lt;/font&gt; search queries, library index&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#616161'&gt;Out:&lt;/font&gt; best-matching act → suggestion" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=3;arcSize=5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="670" y="115" width="190" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="&lt;b&gt;3 · Retrieve (keyword search)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#616161'&gt;In:&lt;/font&gt; search queries&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#616161'&gt;Out:&lt;/font&gt; passages of the selected act, in the user's language" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=4;spacingTop=3;arcSize=5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#E1D5E7;strokeColor=#9673A6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="875" y="115" width="190" height="95" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="&lt;b&gt;4 · Answer (model call)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#616161'&gt;In:&lt;/font&gt; passages + request&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color='#616161'&gt;Out:&lt;/font&gt; plain summary, explanation, quotations, subjects outside the act&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;font color='#757575'&gt;streamed word by word&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=lef